tmp/cache/*
tmp/pids/*
tmp/sessions/*
tmp/storage/*
log/*.log

# Propshaft's compiled output. A stale copy of this was committed at some
# point (predating this app's current form entirely - it still had
# highcharts/chartkick files in it) and silently broke the importmap:
# Propshaft resolved asset_path against this manifest ahead of the live
# filesystem, so any JS pinned after the manifest was generated (the
# entire Action Cable live-updates feature included) returned a 404-style
# "missing asset" and Import maps quietly dropped the pin - the browser
# never got a working module and the whole feature was dead on arrival,
# with no error anywhere in server logs pointing at the real cause. Render
# runs `assets:precompile` fresh on every deploy; there's never a reason
# to have this directory's contents in version control.
/public/assets

# Ignore SQLite databases
storage/*.sqlite3
storage/*.sqlite3-shm
storage/*.sqlite3-wal
storage/*.sqlite3_[0-9]*

# Active Storage's local-disk service writes blobs into hashed
# subdirectories under storage/ in development (and tmp/storage/ in test,
# ignored above) - never real source, never meant to be committed.
storage/*/

# Backups, dumps, and cookie jars — never commit these
/backup-*.sql
/backup-*.sqlite3
*.tar.gz
cookies.txt

# Stray editor/manual backup files
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
*.backup
*.broken

# Local secrets (Stripe keys, etc.) — never commit, see .env.example
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example
